金髪の子が営業しているお菓子屋さんで働いています\n金髪の子は美人で、黒髪の子は平凡か可愛いイメージ\n金髪の子のまつ毛が長いと嬉しいです\n黒髪の子の顔のホクロは忘れないで欲しいです\nイラストは背景の色を除いて、アクスタにできたら嬉しいので、PSDで送って貰えると嬉しいです\n\n参考画像⤵︎ ︎\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1zXQW_EIdv34sVTZ6bl9zT1DX9jSledUA/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/15CU8nf0dzhhpQEq_Zu9G3-SvySEium20/view?usp=drivesdk\n\nTRPGで使用しているキャラクターシート⤵︎ ︎\n\nhttps://iachara.com/view/10016819\n\nhttps://iachara.com/view/10017462", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1830071, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "inuを", "screen_name": "inuo_x", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1516451886001360901/AoZWSGKC.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1410252927902437379/1758369358/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 20, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 129}, {"id": 2943800, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "抹茶の助🍵", "screen_name": "matchadesu0206", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917620884212441091/qkBtrofA.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1238405674695942150/1711970700/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 2943893, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "理解", "screen_name": "gemu_waka", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1502506982166917120/qtIAHDYJ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profil